---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Attio: The CRM for agentic revenue"
  description="The system for revenue teams to build pipeline, accelerate deals, and grow accounts around the clock."
>
  <!-- Hero, Variant B per Appendix C.2 -->
  <section class="hero-fade-in mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 pb-16 pt-16 text-center sm:px-6 sm:pt-24">
    <a
      href="https://atlas.attio.com"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-paper-300 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink-100 hover:bg-paper-400"
    >
      GTM lessons from Elena Verna and more
      <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
    </a>
    <h1 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl font-display text-[56px] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight sm:text-[72px]">
      Welcome to agentic revenue.
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600 sm:text-xl">
      Attio is the platform that builds pipeline, advances deals, and grows accounts around the clock.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="/contact/sales"
        class="rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-100 ring-1 ring-ink-100 hover:bg-paper-200"
      >
        Talk to sales &rarr;
      </a>
      <a
        href="/go/welcome/sign-in"
        class="rounded-full bg-ink-100 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-ink-300"
      >
        Start for free
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero product mock: animated HTML UI cycling 3 frames, no video, no image -->
    <div class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-paper-500 bg-paper-200 text-left shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-paper-500 bg-white px-4 py-3">
        <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="ml-3 text-xs font-medium text-ink-700">Basepoint</span>
        <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-ink-700">Ask Attio</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Frame 1: Ask Attio -->
      <div data-hero-frame="0" class="grid gap-4 p-4 sm:grid-cols-5 sm:p-6">
        <div class="sm:col-span-3">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-700">Good morning, Alex</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium">Ask anything...</p>
          <p class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-white p-3 text-sm font-semibold ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <span data-typing data-text="How do I win my deal with GreenLeaf?">How do I win my deal with GreenLeaf?</span>
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-white p-4 text-sm ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="font-semibold">Strategy to win GreenLeaf</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-ink-600">Deal context: GreenLeaf Intro, Dec 12, 10:40 to 11:32 AM, 48m</p>
            <p class="mt-2 font-medium">Key opportunity signals:</p>
            <ol class="mt-1 list-decimal pl-5 text-ink-600">
              <li>Large startup deal, 52 seats</li>
              <li>Active migration intent</li>
              <li>Strong ICP fit</li>
              <li>Recent engagement</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="mt-3 text-ink-600">Want me to draft an agenda with talking points?</p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-700">Meetings Today, Oct 14</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 sm:col-span-2">
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 text-sm ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="font-semibold">Product Demo w/ GreenLeaf</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-700">10:00 / 28:14, Meeting, Transcript</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-ink-600"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-100">Ashley, 0:02</span> Everything is in spreadsheets right now and it is getting unmanageable.</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-100">Sam, 1:23</span> I would like the whole team moved over by Monday if we can.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 text-sm ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="font-semibold"># pipeline</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-100">Marcus, 10:24</span> @Attio what deals should I focus on today?</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-ink-600">Attio: GreenLeaf, verbal yes, no quote out. Ramp, stalled in Legal 5d.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-ink-100 p-4 text-sm text-white">
            <p class="font-semibold">Find yesterday's demo call and create the right follow-up task.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/70">Ran 3 commands: search-call-recordings-by-metadata, get-call-recording, create-task</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/70">Pulled the transcript, flagged a pricing objection, and queued the AE's follow-up.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-white/60">Opus 4.8, 1M context</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Frame 2: Business Metrics dashboard -->
      <div data-hero-frame="1" class="p-4 sm:p-6" hidden>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Business Metrics</p>
        <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Revenue growth by paid plan</p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex h-28 items-end gap-2">
              <div class="w-full rounded-t bg-blue-500" style="height: 38%"></div>
              <div class="w-full rounded-t bg-blue-500" style="height: 55%"></div>
              <div class="w-full rounded-t bg-blue-500" style="height: 47%"></div>
              <div class="w-full rounded-t bg-blue-500" style="height: 72%"></div>
              <div class="w-full rounded-t bg-blue-500" style="height: 64%"></div>
              <div class="w-full rounded-t bg-blue-500" style="height: 92%"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-700">Q1 to Q4</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Closed-won deals</p>
            <div class="mx-auto mt-4 h-28 w-28 rounded-full" style="background: conic-gradient(#266df0 0 62%, #e4e7ec 62% 100%)"></div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-ink-700">62% closed-won</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">Sales pipeline</p>
            <div class="mt-4 space-y-2">
              <div class="h-6 rounded bg-blue-500" style="width: 100%"></div>
              <div class="h-6 rounded bg-blue-400" style="width: 78%"></div>
              <div class="h-6 rounded bg-blue-300" style="width: 56%"></div>
              <div class="h-6 rounded bg-blue-200" style="width: 34%"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg bg-white p-4 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium">New signups</p>
            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-6 gap-1">
              <div class="h-10 rounded bg-paper-500"></div>
              <div class="h-14 rounded bg-paper-500"></div>
              <div class="h-12 rounded bg-paper-500"></div>
              <div class="h-20 rounded bg-blue-500"></div>
              <div class="h-16 rounded bg-blue-500"></div>
              <div class="h-24 rounded bg-blue-500"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-700">Cohort, by month</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Frame 3: Workflows -->
      <div data-hero-frame="2" class="p-4 sm:p-6" hidden>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Workflows</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-700">Run #7, Run history</p>
        <ol class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white p-3 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-green-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Completed</span>
            <span class="font-medium">When a new deal is created</span>
            <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-ink-700">Trigger</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white p-3 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-green-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Completed</span>
            <span class="font-medium">Web Agent, enrich the record with web research</span>
            <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-ink-700">Agent</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white p-3 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-blue-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Running</span>
            <span class="font-medium">Custom Agent, score the lead and route to the right AE</span>
            <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-ink-700">Agent</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-white p-3 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-paper-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-600">Queued</span>
            <span class="font-medium">Let me query for deals that are ready to close</span>
            <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-ink-700">Ask Attio</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Logo strip -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <p class="text-center text-sm font-medium text-ink-700">Trusted by 30,000+ companies</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-10 gap-y-4 text-xl font-semibold text-ink-600">
      <a href="/customers/granola" class="hover:text-ink-100">Granola</a>
      <span>Turbopuffer</span>
      <span>Parallel</span>
      <a href="/customers/modal" class="hover:text-ink-100">Modal</a>
      <span>Wispr Flow</span>
      <a href="/customers/railway" class="hover:text-ink-100">Railway</a>
      <span>Listen</span>
      <a href="/customers/taskrabbit" class="hover:text-ink-100">Taskrabbit</a>
      <span>AIUC</span>
      <span>Wordsmith</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Platform: sticky scrollspy nav + 5 articles -->
  <section id="platform" class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="max-w-3xl font-display text-heading-md font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-heading-lg">
      The intelligent system that never sleeps.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ink-600">
      Picks up leads at 2am. Catches renewals before they slip. Hands you the answer before you ask.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <nav class="min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start" aria-label="Platform">
        <ul class="space-y-1 border-l-2 border-paper-500 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink-700">
          <li><a href="#home-2026-generate-pipeline" data-spy="home-2026-generate-pipeline" class="block border-l-2 border-transparent -ml-0.5 py-2 pl-4 hover:text-ink-100">Build pipeline</a></li>
          <li><a href="#home-2026-convert-leads" data-spy="home-2026-convert-leads" class="block border-l-2 border-transparent -ml-0.5 py-2 pl-4 hover:text-ink-100">Convert leads</a></li>
          <li><a href="#home-2026-run-sales-motions" data-spy="home-2026-run-sales-motions" class="block border-l-2 border-transparent -ml-0.5 py-2 pl-4 hover:text-ink-100">Run sales motions</a></li>
          <li><a href="#home-2026-forecast-revenue" data-spy="home-2026-forecast-revenue" class="block border-l-2 border-transparent -ml-0.5 py-2 pl-4 hover:text-ink-100">Forecast revenue</a></li>
          <li><a href="#home-2026-retain-and-expand" data-spy="home-2026-retain-and-expand" class="block border-l-2 border-transparent -ml-0.5 py-2 pl-4 hover:text-ink-100">Retain and expand</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <div class="min-w-0 space-y-20">
        <article id="home-2026-generate-pipeline" class="min-w-0 scroll-mt-32">
          <h3 class="font-display text-heading-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Your team, amplified.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-600">Agents prospect and reach out when buyers are looking, building a pipeline of deals ready to win.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-paper-500">
            <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] text-left text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-paper-500 bg-paper-200 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-700">
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Companies to work</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">ICP score</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Owner</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Research note</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-paper-500">
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">OpenAI</td><td class="px-4 py-3">98</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Isla Harrington</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Opened 40+ GTM roles</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Harvey</td><td class="px-4 py-3">97</td><td class="px-4 py-3">George Wilkes</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Hired a new CRO</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Browserbase</td><td class="px-4 py-3">97</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Theo Marshall</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Building its first GTM team</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Cursor</td><td class="px-4 py-3">96</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Amelia Carter</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Opened 14 AE roles this quarter</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Notion</td><td class="px-4 py-3">96</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Nathan Cole</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Opening a new sales hub</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Granola</td><td class="px-4 py-3">92</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Daniel Fraser</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Raised $125M Series C</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Ramp</td><td class="px-4 py-3">91</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Maxwell Turner</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Doubling its sales org this year</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Elevenlabs</td><td class="px-4 py-3">91</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Samuel Clarke</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">New VP Sales from enterprise SaaS</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Linear</td><td class="px-4 py-3">88</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600">Made its first sales hires</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-ink-600"></td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-paper-200 p-4 text-sm ring-1 ring-paper-500">
            <p class="font-semibold">Send follow up email to Maya White</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">The intro email ties Maya's new VP role, the Series C, and 14 open AE roles to faster hiring.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="home-2026-convert-leads" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h3 class="font-display text-heading-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Speed to lead, every time.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-600">New leads get enriched, scored, and routed to the right rep before they ever cool off.</p>
          <h4 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold">Free your reps to sell.</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Agents handle the research and busywork. Reps focus their time where deals get won.</p>
          <h4 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Agents dig. You close.</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Every lead is enriched and qualified, so reps know when and why to engage.</p>
          <ol class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-paper-500 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-blue-500 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Trigger</span><span class="font-medium">Record created</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-paper-500 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Web agent</span><span class="font-medium">Enrich lead with web research</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-paper-500 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Custom agent</span><span class="font-medium">Score lead for ICP fit</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-paper-500 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Route</span><span class="font-medium">Route lead by segment, True or False</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-paper-500 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-ink-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Enroll</span><span class="font-medium">Enroll in sequence, Enterprise sequence or SMB sequence</span></li>
          </ol>
          <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-paper-500 p-4 text-sm">
            <p class="font-semibold">Lead card</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">ICP: 98, New Exec, Warm intro via a16z, $5B Series H</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="home-2026-run-sales-motions" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h3 class="font-display text-heading-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Run every motion, your way.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-600">Pipeline built for how you sell, while agents brief the meetings and keep deals moving.</p>
          <h4 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold">Catch changes to the deal.</h4>
          <h4 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">Skip the review scramble.</h4>
          <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-paper-500">
            <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] text-left text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-paper-500 bg-paper-200 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-700">
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Stage</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Company</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Date</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Value</th>
                  <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Owner</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-paper-500">
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Lumio AI</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Sep 30, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$20,800</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Amelia Carter</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Verda Labs</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Sep 10, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$36,400</td><td class="px-4 py-3">George Hall</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Cortexa</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Aug 28, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$54,000</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Theo Marshall</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Driftwave</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Jul 31, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$31,200</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Nathan Cole</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Synthred</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Aug 12, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$62,500</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Isla Harrington</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Pinevox</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Jul 20, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$11,000</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Rachel Adams</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Northpeak</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Jun 30, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$78,000</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Samuel</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="px-4 py-3">Discovery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Westwind</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Jul 8, 2026</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$26,400</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Paul</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="home-2026-forecast-revenue" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h3 class="font-display text-heading-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">For the people who own the number.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-600">Ask any revenue question. From the weekly forecast to performance by rep, get the answer in seconds.</p>
          <h4 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold">Catch changes to the deal.</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Spot new stakeholders, competitor moves, and stalls before your next call.</p>
          <h4 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Skip the review scramble.</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Walk in with quota coverage, deal velocity, and potential risks already mapped.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-paper-500 p-4 text-sm">
            <p class="font-semibold">Ask Attio: What is the estimate of this week's closed-won deal value</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-ink-600">2 tools used. Attributes searched: 19 results. SQL query executed: 1452 rows in 6.2s.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-paper-200 p-4 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
              <p class="font-semibold">Deals at Risk: Forage, Negotiation, $29,288</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Close date passed today with no signature. Jordan asked for a demo to share internally, a sign a new stakeholder needs convincing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-paper-200 p-4 ring-1 ring-paper-500">
              <p class="font-semibold">Deals at Risk: Helix, Procurement and Signing, $18,280</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Unsigned since June 1 despite a June 15 follow-up. Stalling in legal.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article id="home-2026-retain-and-expand" class="scroll-mt-32">
          <h3 class="font-display text-heading-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Keep more. Grow more.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-600">Agents track the whole book, so you save what's slipping and grow what's rising.</p>
          <h4 class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold">Spot the shift early.</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-ink-600">Whether an account's climbing or cooling, you'll know weeks before the call.</p>
